    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord Channel!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Quicksand offers a dynamic and hardcore gameplay experience with 26 levels designed for non stop action. Engage in heart-pounding combat as you navigate through realistic Middle Eastern environments, including bustling cities, vast deserts, and ancient ruins. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/6090fd4b90998eea434cd5d76afcb3d6.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/6090fd4b90998eea434cd5d76afcb3d6.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/6090fd4b90998eea434cd5d76afcb3d6.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gripping Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a thought-provoking narrative that explores the complexities of war, sacrifice, and the pursuit of peace in the Middle East.<br></li><li><strong>Realistic Middle Eastern Setting:</strong> Experience meticulously crafted environments that capture the essence of the Middle East, from bustling marketplaces to war-ravaged streets.<br></li><li><strong>Intense Third-Person Combat:</strong> Engage in visceral, action-packed combat with responsive controls and an arsenal of authentic weapons at your disposal.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get in the Quicksand's captivating blend of thrilling gameplay, an engaging storyline, and an authentic Middle Eastern setting. Prepare to embark on a dangerous mission that will test your skills, strategic thinking, and courage in the face of adversity. Will you rise to the challenge and become a beacon of hope in the Quicksand?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
