ong> Engage in visceral, action-packed combat with responsive controls and an arsenal of authentic weapons at your disposal.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/80e7fb842492f68df47314d0dbcc167a.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get in the Quicksand's captivating blend of thrilling gameplay, an engaging storyline, and an authentic Middle Eastern setting. Prepare to embark on a dangerous mission that will test your skills, strategic thinking, and courage in the face of adversity. Will you rise to the challenge and become a beacon of hope in the Quicksand?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.poster.avif?t=1691671125\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.webm?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488490/extras/b27a890068ed28dcd013ee93ce261318.mp4?t=1691671125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
